{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/865687-makara-horror-aesthetics","id":865687,"title":"Makara Horror Aesthetics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-14T13:55:58-07:00","id":865687,"title":"Makara Horror Aesthetics","content":"I'm planning a solo play-by-post game for a friend. He decided to take Mentor, which I will be making a Makara Tyrant. A University Professor who drowns the kids with homework is the idea. One problem I'm having is the aesthetics for a Makara Horror and it's Lair. Is it assumed that in the Lair, everything is underwater, but since it's a &quot;dream&quot; they only can't breath if the chamber has the &quot;Suffocating&quot; trait? Or do people assume that some Makara Horrors are less completely aquatic and some simply amphibious like the Creature from the Black Lagoon?<br /> <br /> Any ideas/advice would be great in helping me come up with a good look for my players Mentor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7550-vulcan7200","name":"Vulcan7200","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-14T14:05:07-07:00","id":865694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vulcan7200</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/865687-makara-horror-aesthetics#post865687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm planning a solo play-by-post game for a friend. He decided to take Mentor, which I will be making a Makara Tyrant. A University Professor who drowns the kids with homework is the idea. One problem I'm having is the aesthetics for a Makara Horror and it's Lair. Is it assumed that in the Lair, everything is underwater, but since it's a &amp;quot;dream&amp;quot; they only can't breath if the chamber has the &amp;quot;Suffocating&amp;quot; trait? Or do people assume that some Makara Horrors are less completely aquatic and some simply amphibious like the Creature from the Black Lagoon?<br /> <br /> Any ideas/advice would be great in helping me come up with a good look for my players Mentor.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't need to be aquatic at all. Hell, the Horror could be some kind of giant brass centipede crawling around a maze of bookshelves which, if touched, collapse and bury the unfortunate under thousands of pages covered in incomprehensible formulae and undecipherable, scratchy handwriting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-14T17:58:42-07:00","id":865768,"title":"","content":"Makara are nightmares of the depths as an archetype. While sea monsters are the default they don't need to be oceanic. You could have cave monsters fit the Makara too, so like ajf115 says giant brass centipede the buries people in an avalanche.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T10:40:12-07:00","id":866918,"title":"","content":"And spaaaaaaaace!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1353-riche","name":"RichE","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T18:18:16-07:00","id":867245,"title":"","content":"They can also have Lairs with deserts, blizzards, radioactive wastelands, factories filled with smoke and hungry gears, swamps, jungles, aggressive fungi, mazes, lava and certainly more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}